Ray Panthaki ( Boiling Point , Colette , Gangs of London ) makes us think about modern culture in his directorial debut, In Starland . Clarence Maclin ( Sing Sing ) stars in his, unbelievably, first lead role. The cast also features Bella Maclean ( Rivals ) and Miss Benny ( Club Kid ), among others.

